      "function": "hook",
      "scene_type": "gb_task",
      "spoken": "How do you protect Venice from flooding without sealing off the lagoon for good? The answer lies out of sight on the seabed.",
      "data": {
        "kicker": "Task · MOSE Venice",
        "question": "Flood protection that stays hidden?",
        "question_at": 0.05,
        "tag": {
          "text": "Lido · Malamocco · Chioggia",
          "at": "@lagoon",
          "y": 1010
        }
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "S1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "function": "problem",
      "scene_type": "gb_load",
      "spoken": "According to the lagoon authority, the system is activated when a flood forecast exceeds 110 centimetres. Then the three inlets to the lagoon have to be closed.",
      "data": {
        "headline": "The load case",
        "load": {
          "label": "Closure from forecast",
